	"Description": "Change:\n<br />[b][i][u]1.0.1[/u][/i][/b]:\n<br />[list=1]\n<br />[*]Some details have been optimized.\u00A0\n<br />[*]More items can be got.\u00A0\n<br />[*]Some items' produce rate has been adjusted.\u00A0\n<br />[/list][u][b][i]1.0.2[/i][/b]:[/u]Korean translation has been added.\u00A0Grately thanks to\u00A0[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/users/48693548]jina2ya[/url]\uFEFF.\n<br />[b][i][u]Optional[/u][/i][/b]:A machine will be generated in the casino.You can use clubcoins to buy game coins through it.Greatly thanks to\u00A0[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/users/48693548]jina2ya[/url]\u00A0\uFEFFwho made STF file and TMX file.\n<br />When you and [b][i][u]Gus[/u][/i][/b] became good friends, He'll tell you he found a magic machine from the next town.\u00A0\n<br />[list=1]\n<br />[*]The name of this machine is Gashapon Machines.\n<br />[*]You can buy Gashapon Machines and its recipe from Gus.\u00A0\n<br />[*]Gashapon Machines needs Game Coin to be used.\u00A0\n<br />[*]The Game Coin can be obtained by recycling trash from the recycling machine.\n<br />[/list]当你和格斯成为好朋友之后，他将会告诉你，他在隔壁的小镇发现了一个神奇的机器。\n<br />[list=1]\n<br />[*]这个机器的名字叫扭蛋机。\n<br />[*]你可以从格斯那里买到扭蛋机和它的配方。\n<br />[*]扭蛋机需要游戏币才可以使用。\n<br />[*]游戏币可以通过在回收机中回收垃圾来获得。\n<br />[*]欢迎加入工作室，QQ群号码:819623884\n<br />[/list]Specially thanks to\u00A0[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/users/84780823]Cadd286[/url]\uFEFF who provided images.",
